  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ensure the organizational reform project has a well-documented set of objectives, goals, milestones, etc., so the reform may be done effectively and efficiently; Develop and implement a project management structure, with staff, plans, controls, and performance measures to successfully complete the current tender for a major IT systems upgrade. Improvement in the tax administration&apos;s capacity to monitor and redress noncompliance.</narrative>
  </description>
